ccess":true,"name":"Property - serviceFeature (ar-jo)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"8e13965a-a778-449d-beba-9be8f6fdcdbc\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 1\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"servicesFeatures\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"icon\": \"umb://media/a0df66c37ac6423084eb3fe30c460542\",\n    \"featureTabTitle\": \"عن الخدمة\",\n    \"featureTitle\": null,\n    \"featureBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>المعهد العقاري السعودي أول كيان تعليمي متخصص في مجال العلوم العقارية في المملكة، متخصص بتدريب وتأهيل العاملين في القطاع العقاري السعودي، ومنح الشهادات التأهيلية لممارسة الأنشطة العقارية بكفاءة عالية.</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\"\n  }\n]","newValue":"[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"8e13965a-a778-449d-beba-9be8f6fdcdbc\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 1\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"servicesFeatures\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"icon\": \"umb://media/a0df66c37ac6423084eb3fe30c460542\",\n    \"featureTabTitle\": \"عن الخدمة\",\n    \"featureBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>المعهد العقاري السعودي أول كيان تعليمي متخصص في مجال العلوم العقارية في المملكة، متخصص بتدريب وتأهيل العاملين في القطاع العقاري السعودي، ومنح الشهادات التأهيلية لممارسة الأنشطة العقارية بكفاءة عالية.</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\",\n    \"customPage\": \"\",\n    \"linkedToPage\": \"\"\n  }\n]","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - serviceFeature (en-us)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"ef8517d3-ba18-49a4-9b04-fe10e447bd97\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 1\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"servicesFeatures\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"icon\": \"umb://media/a0df66c37ac6423084eb3fe30c460542\",\n    \"featureTabTitle\": \"About the Service \",\n    \"featureTitle\": null,\n    \"featureBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>The Saudi Real Estate Institute is the first educational institution, in the Kingdom, to specialize in offering courses and training programs in real estate sciences. The institute’s goal is to raise the professional and performance standards of the Saudi real estate sector by training and empowering the sector’s workforce with qualified certifications to perform the real estate sector’s work functions with efficiency. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\"\n  }\n]","newValue":"[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"ef8517d3-ba18-49a4-9b04-fe10e447bd97\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 1\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"servicesFeatures\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"icon\": \"umb://media/a0df66c37ac6423084eb3fe30c460542\",\n    \"featureTabTitle\": \"About the Service \",\n    \"featureTitle\": null,\n    \"featureBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>The Saudi Real Estate Institute is the first educational institution, in the Kingdom, to specialize in offering courses and training programs in real estate sciences. The institute’s goal is to raise the professional and performance standards of the Saudi real estate sector by training and empowering the sector’s workforce with qualified certifications to perform the real estate sector’s work functions with efficiency. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\",\n    \"customPage\": \"\",\n    \"linkedToPage\": \"\"\n  }\n]","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - socialMediaImage","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"(Blank)","newValue":"umb://media/ba6d866b399d4d158df62ecef4617b90","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - support","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"(Blank)","newValue":"{\n  \"layout\": {\n    \"Umbraco.BlockList\": [\n      {\n        \"contentUdi\": \"umb://element/a0422a690c3041d08f5a4d9cb311df2a\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"contentUdi\":